  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mission SARA-fair 2017</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This agro trade mission with several Dutch companies to C&#xF4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire creates the opportunity to introduce Dutch expertise to the fast-growing agro sector of C&#xF4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire. The home base of this mission will be a Dutch Lounge at the SARA fair. The SARA-fair is a huge agriculture event aiming to welcome more than 500,000 guests, 600 businesses, and representatives from 30 countries in November 2017. Not only will companies be introduced to the expanding agricultural market in C&#xF4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire, but it will also provide the Netherlands with valuable information on the opportunities and obstacles in the sector&apos;s growth and the potential role of Dutch development initiatives in C&#xF4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire.</narrative>
  </description>
